 * EXPM - Extended Presentation Manager library
 *
 * sample/shadebtn/shbsmp.rc -- resources for the Shaded Buttons sample.
 *
 * Every control is a WC_shBUTTON (see src/shadebtn/shadebtn.c).  The
 * check box, radio button and three-state indicators are drawn from
 * EXPM.DLL's own pointer resources; the icon buttons below use the
 * pointer resources of the sample itself.
